=== base ===
# Logistics Framework Agreement

This Agreement is made between Thornbury Haulage Ltd (the "Carrier") and Quillon Garden Centres Ltd (the "Customer").

## 7. Insurance
7.1 The Carrier shall maintain goods-in-transit insurance of not less than £250,000 per vehicle.
7.2 The Carrier shall provide a copy of its insurance certificate on request.
=== amendment ===
# Amendment Agreement

This Amendment is made on 14 April 2027 between Thornbury Haulage Ltd (the "Carrier") and Quillon Garden Centres Ltd (the "Customer").

1. With effect from the date of this Amendment, clause 7.1 shall be read as: "The Carrier shall maintain goods-in-transit insurance of not less than £400,000 per vehicle."
